- first_obstruction_cocycle
  preserves: the first hidden payload over a visible quotient fiber
  destroys: direct value if the obstruction is only diagnostic
  next_signal: generate or kill each root/lattice/ear syndrome
- Savitch_midpoint_certificate
  preserves: recursive reachability/compression with named midpoint sidecars
  destroys: metric detail inside each subproblem
  next_signal: bounded-depth witness recursion for observer charts
- Bravais_shape_tensor
  preserves: relation-lattice shape beyond shortest vector or covolume
  destroys: ear/order certificates unless attached
