- successive_minima_covolume
  preserves: Minkowski-style volume pressure with rank/covolume/minima
  destroys: root curve and parity ear legality
  next_signal: tie HYP-3062 fields to extremal rows
- relation_lattice_basis
  preserves: integer relations, low-height walls, signed tails
  destroys: shape class and proof-certificate order
  next_signal: add Bravais-shape and wall-deletion fields
- strong_ear_spine
  preserves: strong-connectivity certificates by labelled ears
  destroys: lattice height and root curve unless coupled
  next_signal: use ears as certificates for proof-obligation digraphs
- odd_ear_parity_spine
  preserves: factor-critical style odd parity certificate
  destroys: metric relation-lattice geometry
  next_signal: test parity of residual proof-obligation ears
- nested_ear_series_parallel_spine
  preserves: nested reducibility and no-crossing proof grammar
  destroys: non-nested obstruction payload
  next_signal: separate nested-refinement O2 from K33 cross-handoff O3
- raw_runner_vertices
  preserves: labelled speeds before quotient
  destroys: proof obligation structure when used alone
  next_signal: only use after a preserved predicate is declared

