====================================================================================================
TWO-MAP ALIGNMENT TABLE
====================================================================================================
- single_value_p0 -> root_curve_zero_locus
  paired with: raw_runner_vertices -> packet_sheaf_legal_exit
  readout: the single value is not the object; the object is the curve plus the legal-forgetting ledger
- PGF_discriminant_break
  paired with: strong_ear_spine / nested_ear_series_parallel_spine
  readout: a root collision should name the structural ear where the proof graph changes
- Lee_Yang_zero_free_region
  paired with: Savitch_midpoint_certificate
  readout: zero exclusion can be certified recursively if each midpoint keeps the missing sidecar
- phi4_quartic_cumulant_stabilizer
  paired with: Bravais_shape_tensor / successive_minima_covolume
  readout: quartic stabilization is a fourth-moment face of the relation-lattice shape, not only a scalar tail
- tournament_Iomega_root_spectrum
  paired with: odd_ear_parity_spine
  readout: tournament root asymmetry and odd-ear parity both measure how cycle-packing avoids factorization
- miss_count_PGF_root_stratum
  paired with: first_obstruction_cocycle
  readout: near-real roots are first-obstruction alarms: attach the payload before promoting the quotient

